{"title":"2025 IOQM/Problem 17","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span id=\"Problem_Statement_.E0.B4.AA.E0.B5.8D.E0.B4.B0.E0.B4.B6.E0.B5.8D.E0.B4.A8.E0.B4.B5.E0.B4.BF.E0.B4.B5.E0.B4.B0.E0.B4.A3.E0.B4.82\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_Statement_പ്രശ്നവിവരണം\">Problem Statement പ്രശ്നവിവരണം</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_IOQM/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem Statement പ്രശ്നവിവരണം\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Assume <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/6/c96dd6ec1dc4ad7520fbdc78fcdbec9edd068d0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/9/659a6a2610357101d77dbae8eb9bf0b3100c08fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" /> are quadratic polynomials that satisfy <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/2/602ba9bfc60c7596893757cbf17bd616b60c15e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{f(-2)}{g(-2)} = \\frac{f(3)}{g(3)} = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"150\" height=\"45\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/1/801e58db57fd058edd259623a4c4995458b88b28.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(5) = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"68\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/6/b16997453f383517433042b247ad177e4cb5145d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(7) = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"78\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/9/dd98e0de6387d6b9061085557e0a8198ff1a385c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(7) = -6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"82\" height=\"20\" />, what is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/e/e3e666a10991c7006492fd948a0a240a7c380e3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(5)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/6/c96dd6ec1dc4ad7520fbdc78fcdbec9edd068d0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/9/659a6a2610357101d77dbae8eb9bf0b3100c08fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" /> എന്നിവ രണ്ട് ക്വാഡ്രാറ്റിക് ബഹുപദങ്ങളാണെന്ന് കരുതുക. അവ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/2/602ba9bfc60c7596893757cbf17bd616b60c15e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{f(-2)}{g(-2)} = \\frac{f(3)}{g(3)} = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"150\" height=\"45\" /> എന്ന നിബന്ധന പാലിക്കുന്നു. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/1/801e58db57fd058edd259623a4c4995458b88b28.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(5) = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"68\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/6/b16997453f383517433042b247ad177e4cb5145d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(7) = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"78\" height=\"20\" />, കൂടാതെ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/9/dd98e0de6387d6b9061085557e0a8198ff1a385c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(7) = -6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"82\" height=\"20\" /> ആണെങ്കിൽ, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/e/e3e666a10991c7006492fd948a0a240a7c380e3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(5)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" /> എത്രയാണ്?\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_.E0.B4.AA.E0.B4.B0.E0.B4.BF.E0.B4.B9.E0.B4.BE.E0.B4.B0.E0.B4.82\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_പരിഹാരം\">Solution പരിഹാരം</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_IOQM/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution പരിഹാരം\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/f/ddfacfb845df4c78653cdd723aa84247a192e8d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h(x) = f(x) - 4g(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"162\" height=\"20\" /> is a quadratic with roots -2 and 3. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/4/8c451e7283dd84cbbe17bad08211742d4f0e432c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a(x+2)(x-3) = h(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"182\" height=\"20\" />, and plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/7/5f7f6230166a491e7a471a03829c792496576480.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=7$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />, we have that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/f/17f81402f0e8001d031c6260ed3bb73466066307.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{12+4 \\times 6}{9 \\times 4} = a \\implies a = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"213\" height=\"40\" />. Thus, if you plug in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/3/c43970aa97091f384854d477a1e1e07356887266.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/e/69efeba785e4c0d74a49b3a880bff62ac6b64a56.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(5) - 8 = 14 \\implies \\boxed{22}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"189\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/f/ddfacfb845df4c78653cdd723aa84247a192e8d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h(x) = f(x) - 4g(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"162\" height=\"20\" /> എന്നത് <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/a/62a76677add1d246708c86edfc7c4b8a40184914.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> എന്നീ മൂലങ്ങളുള്ള ഒരു ക്വാഡ്രാറ്റിക് ആണെന്ന് ശ്രദ്ധിക്കുക. അതിനാൽ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/4/8c451e7283dd84cbbe17bad08211742d4f0e432c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a(x+2)(x-3) = h(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"182\" height=\"20\" /> ആണ്. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/7/5f7f6230166a491e7a471a03829c792496576480.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=7$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" /> പകരം ചെയ്താൽ,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/e/4be7cec10fc0da0af37303892a0f0fa275f67f3b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{12+4 \\times 6}{9 \\times 4} = a \\implies a = 1.\\]\" width=\"212\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>അതിനാൽ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/3/c43970aa97091f384854d477a1e1e07356887266.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> പകരം ചെയ്താൽ,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/6/496dca959ae1ac3f88021948c8e30603e6b427f6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f(5) - 8 = 14 \\implies \\boxed{22}.\\]\" width=\"190\" height=\"23\" />\n</p><p>~Pinotation\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018070528\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.015 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.043 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 117/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5102/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37909:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018070528 and revision id 292669. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}